## What it is

{{DESCRIPTION}}

Audience: {{AUDIENCE}}.
Direction: **{{DIRECTION}}**. Character comes from hierarchy, whitespace and real content, never from extra colours,
sizes, radii, shadows or durations.

## Colour

One accent, neutral surfaces, status colours that always come with a word and an icon. Every colour has a light and a dark
value; components use the token, never the hex.

| Token | Light | Dark | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| `background` | {{COLOR_BACKGROUND}} | {{COLOR_BACKGROUND_DARK}} | The page. |
| `surface` | {{COLOR_SURFACE}} | {{COLOR_SURFACE_DARK}} | Cards, dialogs, menus. |
| `sunk` | {{COLOR_SUNK}} | {{COLOR_SUNK_DARK}} | Wells, columns, table stripes. |
| `on-surface` | {{COLOR_ON_SURFACE}} | {{COLOR_ON_SURFACE_DARK}} | Body text and icons. |
| `on-surface-muted` | {{COLOR_ON_SURFACE_MUTED}} | {{COLOR_ON_SURFACE_MUTED_DARK}} | Secondary text. |
| `primary` | {{COLOR_PRIMARY}} | {{COLOR_PRIMARY_DARK}} | The accent: focus ring, active, primary action. |
| `on-primary` | {{COLOR_ON_PRIMARY}} | {{COLOR_ON_PRIMARY_DARK}} | Text and icons on `primary`. |
| `outline-input` | {{COLOR_OUTLINE_INPUT}} | {{COLOR_OUTLINE_INPUT_DARK}} | Control boundaries (3:1). |
| `outline` | {{COLOR_OUTLINE}} | {{COLOR_OUTLINE_DARK}} | Dividers and card borders. |
| `danger` / `on-danger` | {{COLOR_DANGER}} / {{COLOR_ON_DANGER}} | {{COLOR_DANGER_DARK}} / {{COLOR_ON_DANGER_DARK}} | Errors, destructive actions. |
| `success` / `on-success` | {{COLOR_SUCCESS}} / {{COLOR_ON_SUCCESS}} | {{COLOR_SUCCESS_DARK}} / {{COLOR_ON_SUCCESS_DARK}} | Done, saved. |
| `link` | primary | primary | Inline links. |

Text is at least 4.5:1 and control boundaries 3:1, in both themes; [references/dark-mode.md](references/dark-mode.md) has the computed evidence.

## Type

Font: {{FONT_SANS}}, then the system stack. Mono: {{FONT_MONO}}. Scale (closed): display, h1, h2, h3, body-lg, body,
sm, xs. Body is {{TYPE_BODY_SIZE}} on {{TYPE_BODY_LINE}}. Numbers are tabular.

## Space, radius, elevation

Spacing is the 4px scale ({{TOK_SPACING}}, ...). Radii: sm {{RADIUS_SM}}, md {{RADIUS_MD}}, lg {{RADIUS_LG}}.
Elevation: {{TOK_SHADOWS}}; in dark mode shadows deepen rather than glow.

## Motion

Quick and quiet: {{DURATION_FAST}}, {{DURATION_MID}}, {{DURATION_SLOW}}; `ease-out` for entrances. Reduced motion follows the
project's choice, `$extensions.plumb.motion.reduced` ([references/motion.md](references/motion.md)).

## Icons and voice

One icon set, mapped in [assets/icons/icon-map.json](assets/icons/icon-map.json). Voice: {{VOICE}}. Words are fixed in
[references/vocabulary.md](references/vocabulary.md).

## Still banned

Decorative gradients and glows, blur, continuous animation (except skeletons and in-button spinners), colour-only status,
a second icon set, emoji in the UI, hand-rolled accessibility primitives.

